  descripcion_larga_en = 'Portable pulse oximeter for adult patients, designed for oxygen saturation monitoring in outpatient clinics, general wards and emergencies. Provides reliable SpO2 readings with a simple, robust design, ideal for spot checks and ambulatory patients. Its battery life and connectivity allow extended use without additional equipment.',
