  descripcion_larga_en = 'The remote-table DR system is a fourth-generation dynamic solution that combines digital radiography and fluoroscopy on a single platform. The remote table allows acquisition of full-body images and specific examinations such as pneumoconiosis. Its design optimizes workflow in general radiology.',
