on this page or via I-ME WhatsApp. We confirm availability, lead time and manufacturer documentation."}, {"q": "Is there a PDF datasheet for HUA II Series Mobile Dynamic FPD C-arm?", "a": "No PDF is published on this web sheet yet. I-ME obtains the official manufacturer datasheet when quoting — without inventing specs."}, {"q": "What floor/service problem does HUA II Series Mobile Dynamic FPD C-arm address?", "a": "Mobile C-arm with flat-panel detector (FPD) for dynamic intraoperative imaging, modular configuration and low-dose-oriented design. Exact fit is confirmed with clinical-operational context in I-ME advisory."}], "seo_keywords_es": ["arco en c móvil de radiografía digital dinámica hua ii", "cotización", "equipo hospitalario", "I-ME Colombia"], "seo_keywords_en": ["hua ii series mobile dynamic fpd c-arm", "quote", "hospital equipment", "I-ME Colombia"], "enriquecimiento": {"tipo": "sin_ficha_pdf", "fecha": "2026-10-18", "nota": "Landing ligera sin inventar specs; PDF pendiente de fabricante"}}'::jsonb
